@startuml
left to right direction
actor "DMS Workflow Administrator" as WorkflowAdmin
rectangle "APGC DMS — workflow controls" {
  usecase "Configure WorkflowDefinition / WorkflowStep\n[CURRENT: Django Admin permissions]" as Config
  usecase "Select supported actor type\n[CURRENT: model choices]" as ActorType
  usecase "Reassign pending task\n[CURRENT: custom permission + constraints]" as Reassign
  usecase "Monitor workflow queue / aging\n[FUTURE: role-aware workspace]" as Monitor
  usecase "Publish versioned routing change\n[FUTURE: governance + audit]" as Publish
  usecase "Decide assigned review task\n[CURRENT: assigned reviewer only]" as Decide
}
WorkflowAdmin --> Config
WorkflowAdmin --> ActorType
WorkflowAdmin --> Reassign
WorkflowAdmin ..> Monitor : target capability
WorkflowAdmin ..> Publish : target capability
WorkflowAdmin --> Decide
note bottom of Config
  Migration organization.0007 grants documents.reassign_workflow_tasks
  to this group. It does not grant workflow decision authority.
  Current Internal Memo uses one selected-user review step.
  Administrator role must not itself authorize decisions.
end note
@enduml
